    "title": "USF men's soccer joins Premier League fest, Football Manager booth - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mithil Vyas, Sports Editor ,\n1 days ago Long before sunrise, fans lined the Tampa Riverwalk outside Armature Works for the Premier League Mornings Live fan festival. Over 15,000 fans gathered from April 18-19 as the Premier League brought the event to Tampa Bay for the first time. The free, two-day event marked the league’s 12th stop in the U.S and included live broadcasts of nine matches. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
